      ":question/problem": "Differentiate $-6{e}^{x}(5+\\sin(x)).$\n\n$(- 6 \\left(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 5\\right) e^{x})'=$ $- 6 \\left(\\sin{\\left(x \\right)} + 5\\right) e^{x}\\,+$ {{field-1}}",
